   "code": "MEASURE_RELIABILITY",
   "text": "The reliability of the 'preceding' relationship and the attribution of PPP specifically to the PNR after a drive depends heavily on the accuracy of the derived play-type possession records and the defined temporal window. Mislabeling or imprecise timing could lead to spurious results."
