   "code": "SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER",
   "text": "While there are multiple seasons of data, the specific event sequence (teammate drive immediately followed by a PNR by another player in the same possession) might have a limited sample size, potentially leading to insufficient statistical power to detect a true effect or to confidently reject the null hypothesis."
