  "estimand": "The difference in average PNR PPP when a teammate's drive immediately precedes the PNR within the same possession, compared to PNR PPP without such a preceding drive, controlling for relevant confounding factors.",
  "unit": "PNR possession (individual PNR instances)",
  "sample": "All PNR possessions from NBA 2022-23, 2023-24, 2024-25 regular seasons and playoffs, and NBA 2025-26 regular season (complete). PNRs initiated by any player, excluding those where the PNR initiator was also the driver in the preceding play. The sample will be split into two groups: PNRs preceded by a teammate drive and PNRs not preceded by a teammate drive.",
