  "data_version": "NBA 2022-23 to 2025-26 regular season and playoffs. Derived play-type possession records from the graph database, ensuring consistent labeling across seasons. For 2025-26, only complete regular season data will be used. The definition of 'preceding' will be strictly defined as 'within the same possession and immediately prior to the PNR, with no other initiated play-type event occurring between the drive and the PNR'."
 }
}

